This repository packages a local patch to power-profiles-daemon.

Upstream project: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/upower/power-profiles-daemon
Upstream source is primarily GPL-3. Debian packaging and individual source files may carry different licenses as identified in upstream debian/copyright. The patch is provided for review; the included Debian packages are rebuilt derivatives of the upstream project.

This is an unofficial build and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Ubuntu, Debian, Intel, or the upstream maintainers.
